{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 18840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17560, "text": "Ross? Judge?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 23320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21860, "text": "Everybody back from lunch yet?"}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 24620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23620, "text": "Nope."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 27520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25180, "text": "It's just you and me."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 34500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33360, "text": "By golly, you're right."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 46400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44220, "text": "So, uh, tell me about yourself."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 48060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47040, "text": "I'm 32."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 54280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49180, "text": "I'm a fun -loving tourist whose hobbies\ninclude full -contact karate, Brahma"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 56480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54280, "text": "bull riding, and small -caliber weapons."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 62000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60520, "text": "Quit while you're ahead, sir."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 69020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 67880, "text": "Dean just had a scare, sir."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 71040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69220, "text": "Miss Sullivan, what happened?"}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 75220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71500, "text": "I don't really know. The last thing I\nremembered, I was eating lunch. She took"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 76520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75220, "text": "bite and then she started to choke."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 79600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76860, "text": "Then she fell on the floor in a fit of\nviolent convulsions."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 83720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80740, "text": "You smell wonderful. What's that you're\nwearing?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 87060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86060, "text": "Veal piccata."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 90440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 89320, "text": "Sir, it was incredible."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 91779, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90780, "text": "He saved her life."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 93140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91780, "text": "He was so heroic. Who?"}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 95340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93820, "text": "Please, please, please. Dr."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 96660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95660, "text": "Fielding."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 100630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99630, "text": "Fielding's a doctor?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 102090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 100690, "text": "No, it's just a hobby."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 104890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102770, "text": "Ask about his free home physical."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 109970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107310, "text": "So, how's the patient?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 112010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110410, "text": "He saved Christine?"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 116730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 112290, "text": "It's true. If Dan hadn't been carrying\nthis card, she wouldn't be with us"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 120490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 118730, "text": "Wanda's whip emporium."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 123250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 122010, "text": "The other side."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 125390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 124390, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 127650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 125690, "text": "How to save a choking victim."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 133400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 128680, "text": "Step one, give the victim a swift blow\nto the back to clear air passage. Step"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 135980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 133400, "text": "two, clear the mouth of any foreign\nobject."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 139460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 136180, "text": "Step three, loosen constrictive\nclothing."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 156180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 151600, "text": "Better to be safe than sorry."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 163980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 162120, "text": "Miss Sullivan, he felt you up."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 168400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 166380, "text": "Dan, I owe you everything."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 170800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 168820, "text": "How can I possibly repay you?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 175260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 174260, "text": "Sleep with me."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 180320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178240, "text": "Should have taken death while she had\nthe chance."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 229440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224680, "text": "All right, the hot tub and the car phone\nand the trip to Acapulco, but that is"}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 230440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 229440, "text": "my final offer."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 238400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236060, "text": "Dan, I can't sleep with you."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 240840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239840, "text": "I understand."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 244780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242560, "text": "There's no reason you should feel\nobligated."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 250700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245240, "text": "There isn't? No, of course not. I mean,\nafter all, what did I do but grab you"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 254160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 250700, "text": "from the jaws of death just seconds\nbefore and..."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 255580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254440, "text": "Organizing demise."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 263620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 261620, "text": "Sorority girls. I'll get you sorority\ngirls."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 268000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267000, "text": "Nah."}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 270420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269420, "text": "What am I doing?"}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 272740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 271220, "text": "Negotiating your first slave trade?"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 277560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 274680, "text": "Miss Sullivan, listen, I know this is\nnone of my business."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 280780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279020, "text": "I say that a lot, don't I?"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 284920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 282280, "text": "That's okay, sir. We don't pay attention\nto you no more."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 292420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 288560, "text": "Listen, Dan is just using this as an\nexcuse to hit on you."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 293660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292660, "text": "I know that."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 298760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 293940, "text": "But he saved my life, Your Honor. He\nrescued me. From the jaws of death"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 301220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 298760, "text": "before an agonizing demise."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 307420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 305120, "text": "I'm fine. It's okay. Never mind."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 313100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 307920, "text": "I must have just pulled my back up. when\nI carried Christine's prone, lifeless"}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 316220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 313100, "text": "body to safety."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 321680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320220, "text": "What if I had a sex change?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 325080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323460, "text": "He'd counter with his own."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 330020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328100, "text": "Then none of us would be safe."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 333760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331780, "text": "First case, sir. What do you got, Mac?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 338560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333980, "text": "Oh, trespassing, destruction of private\nproperty, and assault with a chicken."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 341520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339860, "text": "A little foul play, huh?"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 345960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342880, "text": "Well, that's good, sir. Get it all out\nof your system now."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 349220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348220, "text": "What a world."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 352660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 349420, "text": "You try to save someone and they attack\nyou with a smoldering thigh."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 354520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353120, "text": "You're lucky I wasn't making beef."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 357820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 354720, "text": "Hey, guys. You'd feel it if I hit you\nwith the business end of a chuck roast."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 361220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358680, "text": "Gentlemen, gentlemen, what is the\nproblem?"}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 363140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361460, "text": "Mr. Brush here was passing by Mr."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 364880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 363360, "text": "Friedman's residence when he smelled\nsmoke."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 369130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 365370, "text": "He pounded on the door. There was no\nanswer. Whereupon Mr. Brush burst in,"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 372470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369130, "text": "Mr. Friedman attacked him with the\nentree in question."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 388530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381890, "text": "You're walking by. You smell smoke. You\nbreak in, and then you assault"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 392770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 388530, "text": "him with this... Plump, juicy fryer,\nthat's correct."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 398120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394860, "text": "The house was on fire. There were\nbillows of smoke coming out of the"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 401840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 398120, "text": "the god -awful smell of carnage. Oh,\nthat's my special sauce."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 407920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403700, "text": "I was barbecuing, and then this maniac\ntears my door down with an axe."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 409380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408380, "text": "Where'd you get an axe?"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 410780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409680, "text": "It was in my car."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 413240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411560, "text": "You carry an axe in your car?"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 417020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413560, "text": "Along with a rope, blowtorch, and the\njaws of life."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 419780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 418780, "text": "It's a Volvo."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 435820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429740, "text": "ask you to pay some restitution to Mr.\nFreeman here. Your Honor, may I approach"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 436820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 435820, "text": "the bench?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 439400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 437900, "text": "What am I going to say? No."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 445020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 441540, "text": "Your Honor, judge not, lest ye be\njudged."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 448940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 446220, "text": "Kind of puts a crimp in the old job\ndescription, partner."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 454640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450580, "text": "You know, I have been watching the\nproceedings and, well, I must say in all"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 457460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454640, "text": "conscience, this is a travesty of\njustice."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 462640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458280, "text": "No sin was committed here. This man\nrisked his life for another."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 466600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463320, "text": "And how has all of our lives been\nenriched by that experience?"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 472220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467180, "text": "I mean, perhaps there are some of us\nhere who are even alive today due to the"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 474480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 472220, "text": "unselfish generosity of another."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 479020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477880, "text": "No, no."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 485220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 479320, "text": "These people who help their fellow man\nor woman, as the case may be, deserve"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 486540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485220, "text": "recognition of this courtroom."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 492100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487600, "text": "Haven't we all had to say to ourselves,\nhave I truly given?"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 495760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 493220, "text": "Have I given enough of myself?"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 499320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497000, "text": "Have I given until it hurts?"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 504980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503200, "text": "All right, I'll sleep with him!"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 506280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505280, "text": "Say hallelujah!"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 509460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508860, "text": "In"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 516159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509460, "text": "conclusion,"}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 518860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516340, "text": "Your Honor... I would like to state that\neven though my client has pleaded"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 524880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518860, "text": "guilty, we would like to request a"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 529340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524880, "text": "suspended sentence due to the\ncircumstances. Your Honor, may I request"}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 531820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529340, "text": "prosecutor refrain from ogling me during\nmy closing statement?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 535960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532140, "text": "Does the prosecutor have anything\npertinent to add?"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 544560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 537580, "text": "Let the record show that the"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 545560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 544560, "text": "prosecution..."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 551770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548850, "text": "We'll make that a suspended sentence in\nlieu of time served."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 553190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 552190, "text": "What's next, Mac?"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 554390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553390, "text": "That's it, sir."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 555450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554430, "text": "What do you mean, that's it?"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 558590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 556570, "text": "You mean the judicial cupboards are\nbare."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 563590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560010, "text": "They can't be. I mean, with all the\nsenseless, heinous crimes in New York,"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 564930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563610, "text": "surely we can squeeze in one more."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 568650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567510, "text": "Sorry, Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 570730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569130, "text": "Do you have any last requests?"}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 594070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593070, "text": "in front of witnesses."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 596890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594490, "text": "Here. Now, the address is on the key."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 601570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597510, "text": "Knock twice and ask for... mercy."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 607950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 605290, "text": "I'm gonna be loved by you."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 612910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609390, "text": "Not you and nobody else but you."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 614730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613250, "text": "Boo -boo -bee -doo."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 624730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 623370, "text": "Get her to switch to decaf."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 629130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626510, "text": "I'm sorry, Your Honor. I'm a little bit\non edge. No, no, no."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 631350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 629530, "text": "Lizzie Borden was a little bit on edge."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 637070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 632450, "text": "You are downright freaked. Now, come on.\nYou don't have to go through with this."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 638430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637410, "text": "I have no choice."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 642730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639050, "text": "Miss Sullivan, I can't believe you were\nput back on this earth so you could"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 644210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 642730, "text": "sleep with Dan Fielding."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 648870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645130, "text": "Look, I appreciate your concern, Your\nHonor, but I am a big girl now and I can"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 649870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 648870, "text": "make my own decisions."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 652880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650360, "text": "And the sooner I get out of here, the\nsooner this will be over with."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 658960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 656720, "text": "Dan forgot his overnight bag."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 663100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 661680, "text": "See you in September."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 669840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668840, "text": "Careful, Yard. Huh?"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 672600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 670360, "text": "Could have fallen over. Ah, thank you,\nRoss."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 675700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 673620, "text": "I guess this means I saved your life."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 684980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 683980, "text": "Isn't that what you think?"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 686900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685620, "text": "I'll take cash."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 694020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692560, "text": "You're beautiful."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 697620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696040, "text": "You're beyond beautiful."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 701460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700300, "text": "You're divine."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 704140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703380, "text": "Enter"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 710620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 704140, "text": "and"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 712800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710620, "text": "indulge your wildest fantasy."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 730500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726640, "text": "Manager, sir, with the champagne you\nrequested. Oh, great. You found it. Yes,"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 735220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 730500, "text": "indeed. Though it was a difficult task.\nAfter all, Chateau Libido is not one of"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 736220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 735220, "text": "our usual brands."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 739160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737200, "text": "Shall I unscrew it for you?"}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 744300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 740940, "text": "Perfect. This could be the greatest\nnight of my life."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 746640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744840, "text": "Okay, I want this over with before I\nvomit."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 750580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749020, "text": "Let the good times..."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 808030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807030, "text": "Faith?"}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 816970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814090, "text": "I suppose we could use this later, huh?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 822650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821650, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 823950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 822950, "text": "Let's go."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 825990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 824990, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 833350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 829790, "text": "How do I love thee? Let me count the\nways."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 836150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834290, "text": "I know 52 of them."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 840180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 839180, "text": "is cheap."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 841780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840720, "text": "It's boot time."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 846240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845040, "text": "Oh, God."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 852019, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 851040, "text": "What's the matter?"}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 854520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852020, "text": "Uh, uh, spy satellite. You know, I\nbetter close this curtain."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 859520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855900, "text": "Dan! There's a man out on the ledge! Oh,\nman! Ho, ho, ho, ho!"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 861460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859860, "text": "That's silly. Don't! I'm positive!"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 862940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861680, "text": "That's ridiculous. It's just a bird."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 864440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 863340, "text": "I just got a beard."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 866580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 865080, "text": "What are you doing out there?"}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 868380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 867380, "text": "Isn't it obvious?"}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 870000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868680, "text": "I'm plunging to my death."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 871480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870480, "text": "You can't."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 873080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871880, "text": "Why? Yeah, why?"}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 875880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 874720, "text": "Who's that? I don't know."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 877720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 876280, "text": "I'll be going now. No, wait."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 879680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 878380, "text": "It might be for you."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 882240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880500, "text": "I wasn't expecting anybody."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 884780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 883780, "text": "Hi,"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 888680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885200, "text": "guys. I'm real sorry to barge in, but I\nhave some depositions that I need signed"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 892120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 888680, "text": "by morning. And I don't believe I've met\nthe gentleman on the left."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 909880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908880, "text": "for stopping by."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 913860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910360, "text": "Here, uh, you can get whatever\ninformation you need off my driver's"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 916500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914420, "text": "Uh, we got a complaint on a jumper."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 917719, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 916860, "text": "It's a cop!"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 918720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917720, "text": "Okay, freeze!"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 922260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 921260, "text": "Hello."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 924040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922480, "text": "Why are we all on the floor?"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 927060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 925680, "text": "I have no idea."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 929360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928260, "text": "Who the hell is she?"}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 930920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929880, "text": "Who the hell are you?"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 934820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 932100, "text": "It's Harold Phelps, and he's got a gold\ncard."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 942330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 939290, "text": "Because I'm 38 years old. Well, so am I."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 943890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942830, "text": "And I'm a virgin."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 945910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944730, "text": "Happy landings."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 948210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 947210, "text": "Hello."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 949570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948570, "text": "What's going on?"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 952230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950150, "text": "The man on the ledge has never had sex."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 954630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953010, "text": "Oh, my dear Lord."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 960350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956750, "text": "Cyril, if you didn't go around telling\npeople, nobody would know."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 961870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 960870, "text": "Evening."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 964490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 962930, "text": "What's with the virgin in the window?"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 977179, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976239, "text": "Chastity breath."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 978180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977180, "text": "Down!"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 982680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979120, "text": "Hey, listen, I'm tired of Brother Teresa\nhere mucking up my evening."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 987700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 983820, "text": "All right, so you're not getting any.\nBig deal. What about us guys who are?"}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 993860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 989740, "text": "You jump off this thing, splunk down\nthere, splatter all over the sidewalk."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 995480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 993860, "text": "is going to be very upset."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 998480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 995740, "text": "And I'm going to wind up playing with\nthe TV remote all night."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 1002520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000200, "text": "I didn't mean to ruin your evening. It's\njust..."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 1010420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1008080, "text": "anything can do. Well, listen, if you're\ngoing to stay, stay. If you're going to"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 1011420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010420, "text": "jump, jump."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 1014080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012740, "text": "Bye. No."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 1019800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1014960, "text": "Let go. Let go of me. Let go of me. Hey,\nhey."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 1022140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020300, "text": "This man just saved your life."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 1023720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1022720, "text": "And now..."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 1055680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054380, "text": "anything around here."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 1059440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056780, "text": "You know, on you, this works."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 1062580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1061020, "text": "What are you people doing here?"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 1066120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1063260, "text": "Just consider us a sexual swap team."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 1071440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068580, "text": "You thought I wasn't old enough to make\nmy own decisions, didn't you?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 1075280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1071660, "text": "You all thought I needed to be\ncondescended to and chaperoned like a"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 1076280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075280, "text": "girl, didn't you?"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 1078240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1077240, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 1091250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090250, "text": "to get out."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 1099710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098130, "text": "How about a couple of wheat thins?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 1106110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104590, "text": "Kudos for a lovely party."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 1139070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1137290, "text": "the Samoan burial dress here?"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 1142990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140570, "text": "I thought it added that festive touch of\nthe island."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1147370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1143430, "text": "Listen to me. You agreed to this and\nthen you waltz in here dressed in"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1148370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1147370, "text": "Burr's nightie."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1183280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1182280, "text": "supposed to be breathing?"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1185360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184360, "text": "Does it matter?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1187820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1186820, "text": "Not really."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1192120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1190920, "text": "I can't."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1196300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195040, "text": "I beg your pardon?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1199320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196820, "text": "I want to, but I can't."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1203080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201380, "text": "Why? Why?"}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1205120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1203800, "text": "Why do you think why?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1207360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1206080, "text": "You forgot your batteries?"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1216650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214190, "text": "It couldn't be that you respect me."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1220890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218650, "text": "That's it. You respect me, Dan."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1222670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1221530, "text": "All right, fine. Yes, right."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1224390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1222970, "text": "My regular Phil Donahue."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1230170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1225970, "text": "I knew you had a decent side. I knew you\ncouldn't go through with this under the"}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1233490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230170, "text": "circumstances. I knew it. I knew it. I\nknew it. You knew it? Yes."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1234970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233830, "text": "And you didn't tell me?"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1239650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236170, "text": "If you were to find out by yourself, I\nwanted you to see that you are not half"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1242870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1239650, "text": "as desperate as you think you are. Nor\nhalf as smart, obviously."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1248660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244200, "text": "What do you mean by that? I mean, I\nthought... Thought what?"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1254440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251340, "text": "I thought there was a chance you really\nliked me."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1258120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254980, "text": "And all you needed was an excuse to show\nit."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1265000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1260360, "text": "So, you thought by pressuring me into\nthe situation, I'd feel free to... Let"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1266200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265000, "text": "your ya -ya's out, right?"}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1280040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274060, "text": "If the real Dan Fielding, the one I know\nis lurking in there somewhere, were"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1284020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280040, "text": "ever to have the courage to let down his\nguard and be himself, to risk"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1289460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284020, "text": "vulnerability and to approach me with\ncomplete honesty, I don't know what"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1290460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289460, "text": "have happened."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1296320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295320, "text": "Dan,"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1300780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297920, "text": "I had such faith in you when I was\nright."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1302580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301200, "text": "Now, maybe someday..."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1304160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303080, "text": "You'll find some in yourself."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1308480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307100, "text": "Yeah, maybe."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1314200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1309500, "text": "Maybe someday I'll come to grips with\nthese opposing forces inside of me."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1323700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1316920, "text": "But until I do, I am going to hit on you\nevery day of my"}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1324700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323700, "text": "life."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1331670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326190, "text": "As long as there is blood running\nthrough these veins or there is a vacant"}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1336610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331670, "text": "anywhere in this city, you are not going\nto be safe in my presence."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1339130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1337370, "text": "Understood? Mm -hmm."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1341290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340190, "text": "Understood. Max!"}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1343510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1342510, "text": "Dan!"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1348050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1346610, "text": "Let's go get something to eat."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1349350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348310, "text": "I'm not hungry."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1350449, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1349710, "text": "I'll buy."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1351450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350450, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1361030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1358350, "text": "I really do want to thank you for saving\nmy life."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1364210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1362110, "text": "I don't think I'll ever be able to repay\nyou for that."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1369270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1368050, "text": "I think you just did."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1376130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375130, "text": "Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1377290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1376290, "text": "Mr. Fielding."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1380970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1378130, "text": "About those people at work."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1383210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1382210, "text": "Oh, Dan."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1384950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1383330, "text": "Dan, you don't even have to think about\nthem."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1387650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1385470, "text": "As far as I'm concerned, this whole\nthing is..."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1389880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1388060, "text": "Nobody's business but ours."}
